  "//overrides": [
    "Security patches for TRANSITIVE dependencies flagged by Dependabot.",
    "None of these are direct dependencies, so the only way to pull in the",
    "patched versions is to force them here. `npm audit fix` is NOT a",
    "substitute: it proposes downgrading @docusaurus/* from 3.9.x to 3.5.2,",
    "which is a large functional regression to fix transitive CVEs.",
    "Version-keyed entries (`pkg@range`) are used where the tree contains",
    "several majors of the same package and only one of them is vulnerable.",
    "Drop an entry once Docusaurus ships a release that already resolves to",
    "the patched version - `npm ls <pkg>` will then show it with no override."
  ],
  "overrides": {
    "brace-expansion": "^1.1.17",
    "postcss": "^8.5.18",
    "fast-uri": "^3.1.5",
    "sharp": "^0.35.0",
